                                                    <div class="eventWrapper ew3">
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        <div class="eventContent">
                                                            <!-- <img src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//第七届能源互联网技术与应用高峰论坛-25813010.jpg" data-title="9th Energy Interconnection Technologies and Application Summit" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;Under the theme &amp;ldquo;Integration, Synergy and Transformation Toward High-Quality Development of the Energy Internet&amp;rdquo;, this forum actively responds to the national 15th Five-Year Plan priorities for building next-generation power grid platforms, with a strong emphasis on the deep integration of physical energy systems, digital technologies, and market mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Forum focuses on system-level synergy and breakthroughs in the top-level design, technological pathways, and key development challenges of the new energy system; the Forum explores value transformation by addressing full-chain technological upgrades across generation, grid, load, and storage, as well as solutions for integrating high shares of renewable energy, accelerating the evolution from green energy toward a digital energy ecosystem; the Forum also places emphasis on digital integration as a foundational enabler, envisioning the transition from traditional energy interconnection based on &amp;ldquo;physical connectivity&amp;rdquo; toward the Space-Based Energy Internet, and released the abridged version of the Space Energy Internet White Paper, followed by the launch of the Space Energy Internet Innovation Platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Through a combined approach of policy interpretation, technical exchange, and project matchmaking, the Forum aims to build a high-level platform that integrates policy guidance, technological innovation, and industry&amp;ndash;finance collaboration, supporting the Energy Internet in achieving a new phase of high-quality development.&lt;/p&gt;
" alt="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//第七届能源互联网技术与应用高峰论坛-25813010.jpg"/> -->
                                                            <div class="eventImg" style="background-image: url('https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//第七届能源互联网技术与应用高峰论坛-25813010.jpg');" data-src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//第七届能源互联网技术与应用高峰论坛-25813010.jpg" data-title="9th Energy Interconnection Technologies and Application Summit" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;Under the theme &amp;ldquo;Integration, Synergy and Transformation Toward High-Quality Development of the Energy Internet&amp;rdquo;, this forum actively responds to the national 15th Five-Year Plan priorities for building next-generation power grid platforms, with a strong emphasis on the deep integration of physical energy systems, digital technologies, and market mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Forum focuses on system-level synergy and breakthroughs in the top-level design, technological pathways, and key development challenges of the new energy system; the Forum explores value transformation by addressing full-chain technological upgrades across generation, grid, load, and storage, as well as solutions for integrating high shares of renewable energy, accelerating the evolution from green energy toward a digital energy ecosystem; the Forum also places emphasis on digital integration as a foundational enabler, envisioning the transition from traditional energy interconnection based on &amp;ldquo;physical connectivity&amp;rdquo; toward the Space-Based Energy Internet, and released the abridged version of the Space Energy Internet White Paper, followed by the launch of the Space Energy Internet Innovation Platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Through a combined approach of policy interpretation, technical exchange, and project matchmaking, the Forum aims to build a high-level platform that integrates policy guidance, technological innovation, and industry&amp;ndash;finance collaboration, supporting the Energy Internet in achieving a new phase of high-quality development.&lt;/p&gt;
"></div>
                                                            <div class="eventDetail">
                                                                <h2 class="eventTitle">9th Energy Interconnection Technologies and Application Summit</h2>
                                                                <p class="eventTime">09:00-12:30, 3 June </p>
                                                                <p class="eventIntro">
                                                                    Grand Ballroom 3, 
InterContinental Shanghai Hongqiao
                                                                </p>
