                                                                <h2 class="eventTitle">3rd Summit on AI + Energy Digitalization for the New Power Systems</h2>
                                                                <p class="eventTime">13:30-17:30, 3 June </p>
                                                                <p class="eventIntro">
                                                                    Grand Ballroom 3, 
InterContinental Shanghai Hongqiao
                                                                </p>
