                                                            <!-- <img src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球光伏前沿技术大会(1)系统平衡部件-76287736.jpg" data-title="Advanced PV Technology Conference" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;The Global Advanced PV Technology Conference provides an excellent platform for the world&amp;#39;s PV experts and scientists to showcase and share the latest developments in solar energy technologies. Nowadays, the demand of PV industry to reduce the LCOE is becoming increasingly strong, and new integration trend of technology appears. The conference programme encompasses a wide scope of PV technologies, with a focus on different high efficient solar cell technologies, such as HJT/HIT, TOPCon, Perovskites and BC, and Distributed and Floating Solar Systems, BIPV, as well as Solar PV O&amp;amp;M and Smart Grid Technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
" alt="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球光伏前沿技术大会(1)系统平衡部件-76287736.jpg"/> -->
                                                            <div class="eventImg" style="background-image: url('https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球光伏前沿技术大会(1)系统平衡部件-76287736.jpg');" data-src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球光伏前沿技术大会(1)系统平衡部件-76287736.jpg" data-title="Advanced PV Technology Conference" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;The Global Advanced PV Technology Conference provides an excellent platform for the world&amp;#39;s PV experts and scientists to showcase and share the latest developments in solar energy technologies. Nowadays, the demand of PV industry to reduce the LCOE is becoming increasingly strong, and new integration trend of technology appears. The conference programme encompasses a wide scope of PV technologies, with a focus on different high efficient solar cell technologies, such as HJT/HIT, TOPCon, Perovskites and BC, and Distributed and Floating Solar Systems, BIPV, as well as Solar PV O&amp;amp;M and Smart Grid Technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
"></div>
