                                                            <!-- <img src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球绿色能源与光伏金融峰会-92021803.jpg" data-title="14th Global Green Energy and PV Financial Summit" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;This summit, themed &amp;ldquo;Building a New Energy System and a Green Financial Ecosystem to Empower an Energy-Powered Nation,&amp;rdquo; focuses on financial support pathways for the photovoltaic industry&amp;#39;s transition from supplementary to primary energy. The summit features four themes: 1) Innovation in Financial Toolkits:&amp;nbsp;Constructing a green investment and financing system tailored to emerging business models; 2) Scenario-Driven Investment: Commercial Practices in Zero-Carbon Parks, Virtual Power Plants, and Direct Green Power Connections; 3) Digital and Intelligent Empowerment: Reshaping photovoltaic asset management and financial risk control through AI and electricity-computing synergy; 4) Financial Strategies and Energy Transition for Global Supply Chains and ESG Disclosure to Building a Green Future Together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Centered on the framework of &amp;ldquo;financial tools&amp;mdash;application scenarios&amp;mdash;technological foundations&amp;mdash;global perspectives,&amp;rdquo; the summit delves into green finance&amp;rsquo;s innovative mechanisms to promote source-grid-load-storage coordination and enhance the integration capacity of new energy. It aims to facilitate efficient alignment of capital, technology, and markets. By bringing together representatives from industry, academia, research, government, and finance, the summit seeks to explore new pathways for financial empowerment in building an energy-powered nation, providing robust support for the comprehensive green transformation of the economy and society.&lt;/p&gt;
" alt="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球绿色能源与光伏金融峰会-92021803.jpg"/> -->
                                                            <div class="eventImg" style="background-image: url('https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球绿色能源与光伏金融峰会-92021803.jpg');" data-src="https://download.snec.org.cn/SNEC/img/2025/02/13//全球绿色能源与光伏金融峰会-92021803.jpg" data-title="14th Global Green Energy and PV Financial Summit" data-intro="&lt;p&gt;This summit, themed &amp;ldquo;Building a New Energy System and a Green Financial Ecosystem to Empower an Energy-Powered Nation,&amp;rdquo; focuses on financial support pathways for the photovoltaic industry&amp;#39;s transition from supplementary to primary energy. The summit features four themes: 1) Innovation in Financial Toolkits:&amp;nbsp;Constructing a green investment and financing system tailored to emerging business models; 2) Scenario-Driven Investment: Commercial Practices in Zero-Carbon Parks, Virtual Power Plants, and Direct Green Power Connections; 3) Digital and Intelligent Empowerment: Reshaping photovoltaic asset management and financial risk control through AI and electricity-computing synergy; 4) Financial Strategies and Energy Transition for Global Supply Chains and ESG Disclosure to Building a Green Future Together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Centered on the framework of &amp;ldquo;financial tools&amp;mdash;application scenarios&amp;mdash;technological foundations&amp;mdash;global perspectives,&amp;rdquo; the summit delves into green finance&amp;rsquo;s innovative mechanisms to promote source-grid-load-storage coordination and enhance the integration capacity of new energy. It aims to facilitate efficient alignment of capital, technology, and markets. By bringing together representatives from industry, academia, research, government, and finance, the summit seeks to explore new pathways for financial empowerment in building an energy-powered nation, providing robust support for the comprehensive green transformation of the economy and society.&lt;/p&gt;
"></div>
